  "textBooks": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CM03131",
    "sub_id": "04700",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>課堂應準備土地法規(法典)，授課以課堂講義或筆記為主，以下為參考書目</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>李佩芬 (2025)。實用不動產稅法精義 (第12版)。新文京。</li>\n\t<li>柯格鐘 (2023)。稅捐法秩序：稅捐、稅法與基本原則。新學林。</li>\n\t<li>黃茂榮、葛克昌、陳清秀 (2019)。稅法各論。新學林。</li>\n\t<li>黃源浩 (2024)。租稅法 (第3版)。五南。</li>\n\t<li>財政部節稅手冊&nbsp;https://www.etax.nat.gov.tw/etwmain/tax-info/understanding/tax-saving-manual</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>Andersson, F., and Forslid, R. (2003). Tax Competition and Economic Geography. <em>Journal of Public Economic Theory</em>,<em> 5</em>(2), 279-303. https://doi.org/10.1111/1467-9779.00133</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>Oates, W. E., and Schwab, R. M. (2015). The window tax: A case study in excess burden. <em>Journal of Economic Perspectives, 29</em>(1), 163&ndash;180. https://doi.org/10.1257/jep.29.1.163</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>Rosen, H. S. and Gayer, T. (2021). <em>Public Finance</em> (10th ed.). (黃智聰、張敏蕾、潘俊男譯). McGrawHill Education.</div>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
  },
